{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021020020044-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021024519\"/><p>黃竹坑大王爺廟發生火警。</p><p>黃竹坑發生火警，現場在南朗山道1號大王爺廟，昨日(20日)晚上11時41分，多名市民報案，指大王爺廟冒煙起火。消防到場開動一條喉和派出一隊煙帽隊撲救，約10分鐘將火救熄，經調查後，懷疑有香火焫着鐵架釀成火警。事件中，無人受傷。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T18:59:33.597994+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:00:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T18:57:48.534182+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:57:48.534182+00:00","content_hash":"91e3282b6b760e99f737dfa6d2eb8490f06100bd24263d7592eb151944fd623b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}